# Copy to `.env` for local development. `.env` is gitignored — never commit a
# real key.
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the JavaScript bundle, so a
# build made with this set ships the key to anyone who opens the site. Use this
# for local development only. On a deployed build, paste the key into the
# in-app "About → Retrieval" panel instead — it stays in that browser's
# localStorage and never reaches the bundle or the repo.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: pin specific models. Leave blank to auto-select (the app asks the
# API which models the key can use, so it survives Google renaming them).
# VITE_GEMINI_EMBED_MODEL=gemini-embedding-001
# VITE_GEMINI_CHAT_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
